      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To test for hidden or non-obvious issues, utilize automated auditing tools alongside manual testing with screen readers like NVDA or VoiceOver. Pay close attention to ARIA (Accessible Rich Internet Applications) attributes, ensuring they are used correctly and not overused to hide essential information. Simulating an interrupted session or using browser developer tools to check the accessibility tree can reveal underlying structural glitches.",
      "source": "target",
