    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get the technical side, but sometimes it feels like these bugs just pop up out of nowhere and mess everything up even when the code looks fine. do you have any advice on how to handle those unpredictable little issues that seem to haunt a build right before launch?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
