      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For those elusive, unpredictable bugs, shift your testing focus from just *functionality* to *interaction robustness*. Employ comprehensive user journey testing, simulating varied user conditions like slow network speeds or interruptions. Furthermore, rigorous cross-browser and device testing is crucial, as rendering or scripting inconsistencies often surface during real-world use cases.",
      "source": "target",
